    <HediffDef>
        <defName>RestorilSleep</defName>
        <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
        <label>Restoril logic trigger</label>
        <description>The central nervous system is heavily suppressed by Restoril. Throughout this prolonged 24-hour hangover period, the head feels heavy and vision blurs, causing a noticeable decline in consciousness and physical capacities. However, it completely sedates the body, dulling pain and inducing a foggy sense of relief. Due to the profound emotional dampening, the chance of social fights is almost entirely eliminated. Sleep depletion is doubled while hunger depletion is drastically slowed.</description>
        <isBad>false</isBad>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>0.0</severityPerDay>
                <showHoursToRecover>false</showHoursToRecover>
            </li>
            <li Class="HelodBlancasDrug.HediffCompProperties_CompareSetNeedAndRemove">
                <hediffA>Somnifacientstronghold</hediffA>
                <offsetA>0.41</offsetA>
                <hediffB>Amphetaminesstronghold</hediffB>
                <offsetB>0.0</offsetB>
                <need>Rest</need>
                <targetValue>0.0</targetValue>
            </li>
            <li Class="HelodBlancasDrug.HediffCompProperties_CompareGiveHediffAndRemove">
                <hediffA>Somnifacientstronghold</hediffA>
                <offsetA>0.41</offsetA>
                <hediffB>Amphetaminesstronghold</hediffB>
                <offsetB>0.0</offsetB>
                <hediffToGive>RestorilDeepSleeper</hediffToGive>
                <severityToGive>1.0</severityToGive>
            </li>

        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li><visible>false</visible></li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>

    <!--레스토릴
    깊은잠 부여자-->

    <HediffDef>
        <defName>RestorilDeepSleeper</defName>
        <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
        <label>deep sleep ready (restoril)</label>
        <labelNoun>a deep sleep ready</labelNoun>
        <description>The sedative factor of Restoril has successfully overpowered the active stimulants in the body, leaving the pawn ready for forced deep sleep. Once a pawn with this condition lies down on a bed or sleeping spot to rest, they will transition into the restorative 'Deep Sleep' stage. This preparatory state itself applies no physical or mental offsets.</description>
        <defaultLabelColor>(1,0,0.5)</defaultLabelColor>
        <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
        <isBad>false</isBad>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-1.0</severityPerDay>
                <showHoursToRecover>true</showHoursToRecover>
            </li>
            <li Class="HelodBlancasDrug.HediffCompProperties_SleepLogic">
                <hediffToGive>DeepSleep</hediffToGive>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li>
                <label>sleep-ready</label>
            </li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>

    <!--Z-drugs
    공통-->

    <!--=======================내성=================-->

    <HediffDef ParentName="DrugToleranceBase">
        <defName>ZDrugsTolerance</defName>
        <label>Z-drugs tolerance</label>
        <description>The body's physical adaptation to continuous exposure to Z-drugs. This tolerance itself applies no direct offsets to physical capacities, nor does it affect the drug's sedative factor or hangover duration. It functions purely as a metabolic metric; if chronic abuse allows this tolerance to build up excessively, it breaks down the body's natural resistance, leading directly to a full Z-drugs addiction upon subsequent doses.</description>
        <descriptionHyperlinks>
            <ThingDef>Sonata</ThingDef>
            <ThingDef>Ambien</ThingDef>
        </descriptionHyperlinks>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-0.005</severityPerDay>
            </li>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_DrugEffectFactor">
                <chemical>ZDrugs</chemical>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <hediffGivers>
            <li Class="HediffGiver_RandomDrugEffect">
                <hediff>ChemicalDamageModerate</hediff>
                <severityToMtbDaysCurve>
                    <points>
                        <li>(0.45, 99999)</li>
                        <li>(0.5, 120)</li>
                        <li>(1, 90)</li>
                    </points>
                </severityToMtbDaysCurve>
                <partsToAffect>
                    <li>Brain</li>
                </partsToAffect>
            </li>
        </hediffGivers>
    </HediffDef>

    <!--=======================중독=================-->

    <HediffDef ParentName="AddictionBase">
        <defName>ZDrugsAddiction</defName>
        <label>Z-drugs addiction</label>
        <description>A chronic addiction where the brain's sleep-wake gateways have been fundamentally altered by Z-drugs. Withdrawal causes a catastrophic spike in sleep depletion due to rebound insomnia, yet the actual efficiency of any rest is severely penalized. Despite profound exhaustion, the mind remains trapped in a warped state of hyper-awareness, suffering from visual distortions, cognitive decay, and horrific waking night terrors.</description>
        <descriptionHyperlinks>
            <ThingDef>Sonata</ThingDef>
            <ThingDef>Ambien</ThingDef>
        </descriptionHyperlinks>
        <hediffClass>Hediff_Addiction</hediffClass>
        <chemicalNeed>Chemical_ZDrugs</chemicalNeed>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-0.045</severityPerDay>
                <showDaysToRecover>true</showDaysToRecover>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li /> <!-- Stage 0: Satisfied (hidden) -->
            <li>
                <label>withdrawal</label>
                <painFactor>3</painFactor>
                <capMods>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
                        <offset>-0.10</offset>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Moving</capacity>
                        <offset>-0.10</offset>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Sight</capacity>
                        <offset>-0.10</offset>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
                        <offset>-0.10</offset>
                    </li>
                </capMods>
                <mentalStateGivers>
                    <li>
                        <mentalState>Binging_DrugExtreme</mentalState>
                        <mtbDays>80</mtbDays>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <mentalState>Wander_Psychotic</mentalState>
                        <mtbDays>5</mtbDays>
                    </li>
                </mentalStateGivers>
            </li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>

    <!--벤조디아제핀
    공통-->

    <HediffDef ParentName="DrugToleranceBase">
        <defName>BenzodiazepinesTolerance</defName>
        <label>benzodiazepines tolerance</label>
        <description>The body's physical adaptation to continuous exposure to benzodiazepines. This tolerance itself applies no direct offsets to physical capacities, nor does it affect the drug's sedative factor or hangover duration. However, if chronic abuse allows this tolerance to build up excessively, it breaks down the body's natural resistance, acting as the direct catalyst that triggers a full benzodiazepine addiction upon subsequent doses.</description>
        <descriptionHyperlinks>
            <ThingDef>Restoril</ThingDef>
        </descriptionHyperlinks>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-0.01</severityPerDay>
            </li>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_DrugEffectFactor">
                <chemical>Benzodiazepines</chemical>
            </li>
        </comps>
    </HediffDef>

    <HediffDef ParentName="AddictionBase">
        <defName>BenzodiazepinesAddiction</defName>
        <label>benzodiazepines addiction</label>
        <description>A state of total chemical subordination to benzodiazepine compounds. While functional or placid under the drug's influence, the cessation of intake causes the suppressed neural pathways to hyper-fire simultaneously. This withdrawal state forces the pawn into profound physical tremors, hallucinations, severe panic, and deep clinical depression, leaving them with an incredibly low mental break threshold.</description>
        <descriptionHyperlinks>
            <ThingDef>Restoril</ThingDef>
        </descriptionHyperlinks>
        <hediffClass>Hediff_Addiction</hediffClass>
        <chemicalNeed>Chemical_Benzodiazepines</chemicalNeed>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-0.03</severityPerDay>
                <showDaysToRecover>true</showDaysToRecover>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li /> <!-- Stage 0: Satisfied (hidden) -->
            <li>
                <label>withdrawal</label>
                <painFactor>2</painFactor>
                <capMods>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
                        <offset>-0.20</offset>
                    </li>
                </capMods>
            </li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>

    <!--수면제
    값-->

    <HediffDef>
        <defName>Somnifacientstronghold</defName>
        <label>Somnifacient accumulation</label>
        <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
        <description>An indicator representing the total accumulated sedative factors within the body. Unlike stimulant accumulation, this metric functions strictly as a backend baseline to track central nervous system suppression without inflicting internal organ damage.\nWhile the presence of Modafinil allows the pawn to completely bypass this metric and prepare for deep sleep immediately, it must still directly outweigh any active Amphetamine factors in the system to successfully unlock the deep sleep ready sequence.</description>
        <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>0.0</severityPerDay>
                <showDaysToRecover>false</showDaysToRecover>
            </li>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_RemoveIfOtherHediff">
                <hediffs>
                    <li>DeepSleep</li>
                </hediffs>
                <stages>0</stages>
                <mtbHours>0.1</mtbHours>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li>
                <label>saturated</label>
            </li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>


    <!--깊은잠-->

    <HediffDef>
        <defName>DeepSleep</defName>
        <label>Deep Sleep</label>
        <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
        <description>An artificially induced, exceptionally deep comatose sleep state brought on by potent sedatives. Lasting for exactly 6 hours, the pawn's consciousness is forcefully capped at a maximum of 30%, ensuring they cannot be prematurely awoken by external noise, minor disturbances, or pain.\nAs the body enters this profound state of uninhibited rest, the sleep need replenishes at an accelerated rate, while simultaneously purging and clearing all active stimulant and amphetamine factors tearing through the system.</description>
        <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
        <comps>
            <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
                <severityPerDay>-4.0</severityPerDay>
                <showDaysToRecover>true</showDaysToRecover>
            </li>
        </comps>
        <stages>
            <li>
                <label>sleeping</label>
                <painFactor>0.6</painFactor>
                <statOffsets>
                    <RestRateMultiplier>1.0</RestRateMultiplier>
                </statOffsets>
                <capMods>
                    <li>
                        <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
                        <postFactor>0.3</postFactor>
                    </li>
                </capMods>
            </li>
        </stages>
    </HediffDef>
</Defs>
